# Patch backups. Note: not a blanket `*.orig` -- the repo deliberately tracks
# some (e.g. experiments/bench_results/gemv_inject_backup/__init__.py.orig), and
# a broad glob would silently swallow future ones. This is the pristine copy of
# a vendor file that an ad-hoc instrumentation patch was diffed against: 90+ KB,
# and fully described by the patch's diff header.
experiments/src/_vllm_orig/
